## Phase Breakdown & Scope of Work

### Phase 1: `packages/shared` — Shared Contracts & Build System
*Target Files: `packages/shared/package.json`, `tsconfig.json`, `src/index.ts`, `src/constants/*`, `src/types/index.ts`, `src/validation/*`, `src/utils/*`*

- [x] **[CRITICAL] Fix ESM/CJS Export Map**: Update `package.json` and TypeScript configuration so Vite client imports compiled code and declaration types without bundling raw TypeScript.
- [x] **[HIGH] Decouple UI & Execution Configs**: Split `LanguageConfig` into `LanguageExecutionConfig` (backend) and `LanguageUIConfig` (client Monaco/starter templates).
- [x] **[HIGH] Relocate Judge Logic**: Move `diffOutput.ts` to worker sandbox or export cleanly as a dedicated utility without bloating UI consumers.
- [x] **[HIGH] Unify `ISubmissionResponse` & `ISolution`**: Remove redundant `status` field in favor of canonical `verdict: Verdict`; ensure type inheritance.
- [x] **[MEDIUM] Canonical `ProblemDifficulty` Object**: Create `ProblemDifficulties` `as const` object and derive types and Zod enums from a single source of truth.
- [x] **[MEDIUM] Split `QueueConfig` and `ExecutionLimits`**: Decouple BullMQ queue constants from execution boundary constants.
- [x] **[LOW] Password Strength in `auth.schema.ts`**: Update `registerSchema` to enforce 8+ chars with at least one letter and one number.
- [x] **[LOW] Readonly Verdict Arrays**: Make `ALL_VERDICTS` `readonly` to prevent runtime array mutations.

---

### Phase 2: `apps/worker` — Sandbox Engine, Idempotency & Reliability
*Target Files: `apps/worker/src/worker.ts`, `src/config/*`, `src/queue/submissionWorker.ts`, `src/sandbox/*`, `docker/runner.sh`, `docker/Dockerfile.runner`, `Dockerfile`*

- [x] **[CRITICAL] Idempotency & Double-Count Prevention**: Add check to ensure non-PENDING submissions are not re-evaluated; make `acceptedSubmissions` counter increment conditional on state transition.
- [x] **[CRITICAL] Zombie Docker Container Leak**: Assign deterministic container names (`oj-${submissionId}-${testCase}`) and trigger explicit `docker kill` on timeout / process abortion.
- [x] **[CRITICAL] Shell Injection in `runner.sh`**: Strictly allowlist `$LANG` (exact string match `cpp` | `python`), quote `"$CMD"`, and sanitize arguments.
- [x] **[CRITICAL] Process Lifecycle Guards**: Register `unhandledRejection` and `uncaughtException` in `worker.ts` for clean logging and fail-safe shutdown.
- [x] **[HIGH] Dead Letter Queue (DLQ) Compensation**: In `worker.on('failed')`, update Solution record to `INTERNAL_ERROR` when max retries are exhausted.
- [x] **[HIGH] Output File Disk Flooding Protection**: Cap stdout in `runner.sh` (`head -c 65536`) and set tmpfs memory bounds to prevent host disk exhaustion.
- [x] **[HIGH] Strict Mongoose Models**: Align worker database models with server strict schemas.
- [x] **[MEDIUM] Zero-Metrics Anomaly Detection**: Add fallback in evaluator so missing metrics are classified as `INTERNAL_ERROR` instead of false `WRONG_ANSWER`.
- [x] **[MEDIUM] Redis Readiness Ping**: Add `await redisClient.ping()` during worker startup bootstrap.
- [x] **[MEDIUM] Base-10 Exit Code Parsing**: Fix `parseInt(val, 10)` for GNU time exit status.
- [x] **[MEDIUM] Windows Docker Path Normalization**: Support Windows path conversion for Docker Desktop volume mounting.
- [x] **[LOW] Shutdown & Cleanup**: Await `redisClient.disconnect()`, add test skip guards when Docker is absent.

---

### Phase 3: `apps/server` — Routing, Security, Performance & Sample Runner
*Target Files: `apps/server/src/server.ts`, `src/config/*`, `src/middlewares/*`, `src/controllers/*`, `src/models/*`, `src/routes/*`, `src/queues/*`, `src/seeds/*`*

- [x] **[CRITICAL] Route Shadowing Fix**: Reorder `submission.routes.ts` so `/user/:userId` and `/problem/:problemId` are registered **before** `/:id`.
- [x] **[CRITICAL] JWT Secret Hardening**: Remove hardcoded fallback secret in `env.ts`; enforce strict Zod startup validation for environment variables.
- [x] **[CRITICAL] BOLA / Authorization in `getSubmissionById`**: Enforce 403 Forbidden when an unauthorized user attempts to view private submission details.
- [x] **[CRITICAL] Submission Rate Limiting**: Implement strict per-user rate limit (e.g. 10/min) on `POST /submissions` and reject concurrent pending submissions.
- [x] **[CROSS-BOUNDARY NEW FEATURE] Real Sample Runner API**: Implement `POST /api/submissions/run` to execute user code against sample test cases in real-time.
- [x] **[HIGH] ReDoS & Query Sanitization**: Escape regex strings in `getProblems` and enforce max query string lengths.
- [x] **[HIGH] N+1 Query Optimization in `getMe`**: Replace in-memory loops with a MongoDB aggregation pipeline for user statistics.
- [x] **[HIGH] Field Projection in Problem Submissions**: Allowlist fields via `.select()` in `getProblemSubmissions`.
- [x] **[HIGH] Atomic Creation & Queue Compensation**: Rollback created Solution document and decrement counter if `enqueueSubmission` throws.
- [x] **[HIGH] Queue Graceful Shutdown**: Await `submissionQueue.close()` before disconnecting Redis on SIGTERM.
- [x] **[MEDIUM] Compound Database Indexes**: Add `{ user: 1, problem: 1 }` and `{ user: 1, verdict: 1 }` indexes to `Solution`; add text index to `Problem`.
- [x] **[MEDIUM] Decouple Auth & Global Rate Limiters**: Prevent double-counting on `/api/auth` endpoints.
- [x] **[MEDIUM] 404 URL Sanitization**: Remove reflected request URLs from 404 responses.
- [x] **[LOW] ESM Seeder & CSRF Protection**: Fix `seedProblems.ts` execution check for tsx/ESM; add `requireAuth` to logout.

